==Portuguese==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|roa-opt|pt}} {{m|roa-opt|esperar}}, {{m|roa-opt|asperar}}, from {{etyl|la|pt}} {{m|la|spērāre}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|spērō||hope, expect}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|pt}} {{m|ine-pro|*speh₁-||to prosper, to turn out well}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|PT}} {{IPA|/ˌɨʃ.pɨ.ˈɾaɾ/|/ˌiʃ.pɨ.ˈɾaɾ/|/ʃpɨ.ˈɾaɾ/|lang=pt}}

===Verb===
{{pt-verb|esper|ar}}

# {{senseid|pt|to await}} {{indtr|pt|por|intr=1|direct=1}} to {{l|en|wait}} (for); to {{l|en|await}}
#: {{ux|pt|Eu '''espero''' por sua resposta.|I '''await''' your response.}}
#: {{ux|pt|Fiquei '''esperando''' no carro.|I '''waited''' in the car.}}
# {{senseid|pt|to wait for something to happen}} {{lb|pt|transitive|auxiliary|_|with a verb in the personal infinitive as the second object}} to {{l|en|wait}} for {{gloss|not to do anything until}}
#: {{ux|pt|'''Espere''' o João chegar.|'''Wait''' for John to arrive.}}
# {{senseid|pt|to hope for}} {{indtr|pt|por}} to {{l|en|hope}} for {{gloss|to really want something}}
#: {{ux|pt|Eles '''esperam''' pelo fim da guerra.|They '''hope''' for the end of the war.}}
# {{senseid|pt|to hope that}} {{indtr|pt|que|ditr=1|aux=present subjunctive}} to {{l|en|hope}} (that) someone does something
#: {{ux|pt|Eu '''espero''' que gostes do presente.|I '''hope''' you like the gift.}}
# {{senseid|pt|to hope something can be done}} {{lb|pt|auxiliary|_|with a verb in the personal or impersonal infinitive}} to {{l|en|hope}} something can be done
#: {{ux|pt|'''Esperávamos''' comer alguma coisa hoje.|'''We were hoping''' to eat something today.}}
# {{senseid|pt|to expect}} {{indtr|pt|por|intr=1|direct=1}} to {{l|en|expect}}; to {{l|en|anticipate}} {{gloss|to know that something will happen}}
#: {{ux|pt|É melhor do que eu '''esperava'''.|It is better than I '''expected'''.}}
#: {{ux|pt|Eu já '''esperava''' por isso mesmo.|I was '''expecting this''' anyway.}}

====Conjugation====
{{pt-conj|esper|ar}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|to await}} {{l|pt|aguardar}}
* {{sense|to wait for}} {{l|pt|aguardar}}
* {{sense|to expect}} {{l|pt|aguardar}}

====Further reading====
* {{R:DAN}}

